<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's Costello to hold briefing.</title>
<headline>Australia's Costello to hold briefing.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-05-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a 0030 GMT (10.30 a.m.) briefing on Friday on the latest official interest rate cut, his office said.</p>
<p>The briefing will be in Melbourne. The Reserve Bank of Australia on Friday cut official rates by 0.5 percentage points, the fourth such cut in less than a year.</p>
<p>-- Canberra bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
